WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.640
- I am very excited about your movie.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.490
I have to lead with that.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:05.380
It's also very lovely to meet you

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.035
but that just energized me so much.

00:00:08.035 --> 00:00:09.130
I'm very excited.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:10.390
I can't wait for it.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:12.190
And it all started, this is what I love.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:15.807
Everything started from you
tweeting this tweet in 2014.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.980
"Hey, Marvel, great job with
Captain America and Thor.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.360
Now how about an Asian American hero?"

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.530
So did you have any expectations

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.430
after that tweet of maybe
them possibly reaching out?

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.770
- Yeah. Yeah, for sure.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:32.640
I tweeted in 2014 and I was
like a struggling actor,

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.210
I was handing out dog food samples

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.720
on the side of the road in Toronto.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.630
And I was like, yeah, I'm going

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.990
to tweet Marvel and
it's going to be great.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.570
They're going to read the tweet,

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.880
get back to me, offer me a role.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.200
And so basically everything's worked

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.550
out as planned and yeah.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.330
- That's amazing, but years later it did..

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.720
- No I had absolutely no
idea it was going to happen.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.760
It was just kind of a
facetious thing that I tweeted

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:54.760
and what's happening in these
next few years has just been

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.500
pretty incredible and pretty insane.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.056
So I'm still pinching myself
every day, to be honest.

00:00:59.056 --> 00:01:01.650
- But after getting the part you replied

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:05.573
to your own tweet,
"LOL", which was awesome.

00:01:05.573 --> 00:01:09.110
You're like, "hey, you know
what? I am Nostradamus."

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:12.050
- Almost to the day actually
it was July 17th and I was like

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.840
I was cast on July 21st, oh my God.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.707
- That's crazy. - It works out.

